{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/星陨之炎","pageid":5058,"revid":11449,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%98%9F%E9%99%A8%E4%B9%8B%E7%82%8E&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%98%9F%E9%99%A8%E4%B9%8B%E7%82%8E&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%98%9F%E9%99%A8%E4%B9%8B%E7%82%8E&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>星陨之炎</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E6.98.9F.E9.99.A8.E4.B9.8B.E7.82.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"星陨之炎\"><b>星陨之炎</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 星陨之炎.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b9/lpxodowr4i8jyeiu0nq4t36ce0uj0se.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%98%9F%E9%99%A8%E4%B9%8B%E7%82%8E.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/b/b9/lpxodowr4i8jyeiu0nq4t36ce0uj0se.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E6%98%9F%E9%99%A8%E4%B9%8B%E7%82%8E.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/b/b9/lpxodowr4i8jyeiu0nq4t36ce0uj0se.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />星陨之炎\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓8-↑8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓2-↑2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（魔法伤害）选择目标地形格，若其范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内不存在[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]地形，则对范围内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#d68fe2\">70%</font>[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"火属性\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">火属性</font></span></span>][<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">范围伤害</span>]，并使中心及其范围1圈地形格强制变为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]；若存在[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]地形，则对范围内所有敌人造成伤害提高至<font color=\"#d68fe2\">140%</font>，再吸收[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"燃烧\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">燃烧</font></span></span>]地形。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4 3.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/df/6yv5uheq339bec6azjhmfdefj74z2gi.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4_3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/d/df/6yv5uheq339bec6azjhmfdefj74z2gi.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9C%B2%E7%BB%B4%E5%A1%94\" title=\"角色图鉴库/露维塔\"><img alt=\"头像 露维塔.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/0e/qckz6jz4u7j1hp6h7vpepon63bqyuva.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">露维塔</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-